.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH voltkit-convert 1  "Voltkit 0.6.0" "Voltkit Manual"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
voltkit\-convert \- Convert text from standard input with one of Smart Paste\*(Aqs conversions
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvoltkit convert\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICONVERSION\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert text from standard input with one of Smart Paste\*(Aqs conversions
.PP
Without CONVERSION, lists them.
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fICONVERSION\fR]
A conversion such as json, markdown\-table, clean\-link or snake
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
List the conversions:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBvoltkit convert\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Tidy JSON from a file:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBvoltkit convert json < data.json\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Turn a copied spreadsheet range into a Markdown table:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBwl\-paste | voltkit convert markdown\-table\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Remove tracking from a link:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBecho \*(Aqhttps://example.com/?utm_source=x\*(Aq | voltkit convert clean\-link\fR
.fi
.RE
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBvoltkit\fR(1)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
